<title>USA: American Health files $300 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>American Health files $300 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Health Properties Inc filed a shelf offering with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission on Thursday for up to $300 million in debt securities, preferred, depositary shares, common shares and warrants.</p>
<p>The Englewood, Col., real estate investment trust said proceeds from the sale will be used for working capital needs, acquisitions, capital expenditures and other general corporate needs.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the filing.</p>
